{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月22日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で16歳の誕生日を迎えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/03/22/1455086/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16年前の6:59に福岡で生まれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ7:00やったのに！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、長崎で育ちました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"保育園の時から、夢は芸能人でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2次元とアイドルが好きでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地球温暖化について考えてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜露死苦とかSmileとか心友"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って字にハマってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼休みは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"探偵ごっこや木に話しかけたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔法使ったり図書室にこもったりʚ♡ɞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学校では、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しなメンバーで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋上へつながる踊り場でお話ししたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルさんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振りコピの練習したりヾ(｡･ω･｡) ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだった中学校が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廃校になったのは悲しかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして13歳の夏休み。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のオーディションに合格。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受かる気がしていなかったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄くびっくりしました✧。+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休み明けに東京に上京しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/03/22/1455086/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に渋谷と原宿が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あると思ってなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて遊びに行った時はびっくりしました！それと、ディズニーも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/03/22/1455086/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミス田舎もんが懐かしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/03/22/1455086/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入ってからは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つのがあっという間だなっ!♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、たくさんのいい経験をして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濃い毎日を過ごせています！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに祝ってもらうのはもう3回目！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年たくさんの方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おめでとう！」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言っていただいて幸せです(´,,･ω･,,`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のメンバーで